  "description": "API probe P20-A (decision 107; phase1.15_compositor-colour-fits item 2.1): the fill channel defaults on the plane, Legacy, no template (channels BaseColor, BaseMetalness, Height, Normal, SpecularRoughness). checker (16x16 8-bit colour) and mask_left_half (16x16 8-bit grey) imported. A fill with every channel active and checker bound on each; above it a fill with mask_left_half bound on each, under a black mask whose fill effect is checker; on top a fresh fill whose active channels are assigned every channel and nothing else, under a black mask whose fill effect is mask_left_half. Read back: the fresh fill's active channels and get_source of each channel (its working-space colour); get_source, get_color_space and list_available_color_spaces of each bound bitmap, on every channel and in both masks; in the first session and after save/reopen, with the events and every channel exported (PNG 16, infinite padding).",
